SUMMARY:Overpaying the mortgage beats cash savings
DESCRIPTION:Your mortgage costs 4.5% and cash earns 3.5%\, so overpaying is
  a guaranteed saving once your emergency fund is in place.\n1. Check your 
 lender’s yearly overpayment limit first (often 10% of the balance)\, so 
 you don’t pay an early repayment charge.\n2. Ask whether overpaying shor
 tens your term or lowers your monthly payment.\n3. Set it up with your len
 der as a regular monthly amount or a lump sum.
